The '''Lonely Island''' was a sub-location of {{Zone|Spruce Woods}} in [[The Park]]. It has since been entirely replaced with the {{Zone|Viking Longhouse}}.

{{ZoneText|Explore the lonely structure.}}

== Features ==
The '''Lonely Island''' featured the {{Zone|Viking Longhouse}} sub-zone, which is a large structure that covered most of the '''Lonely Island'''. It is a large hall with a [[Furnace]] and fireplace, and a large wooden throne where the {{NPCSprite|Melancholic Viking}} can be found.

